+  blocked by missing authorized private channel`, options A/B/C, "Required external authorization/channel
+  (not currently available)"); `git remote -v` → public `git@github.com:ottojung/viche.git`; `gh auth status`
+  → not logged in; absent `~/.ssh/config` and `ssh -G marceline-dev` → unresolved default host, port 22,
+  no proxy; canonical `records/research/2026-11-24-founder-proof-production-study.md` section 5 ("separate
+  network namespaces, no SSH listener observed... repository is PUBLIC... do not put unpublished proof
+  sources or credentials in public relay refs").
+- **Finding:** a genuine material **external-authorization** blocker, independently confirmed and still
